<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="mn">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Найздаа 😎</title>
<style>
body{
  background: linear-gradient(#89f7fe,#66a6ff);
  font-family: Arial;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  height:100vh;
}
.card{
  background:white;
  padding:30px;
  border-radius:20px;
  text-align:center;
  width:300px;
}
button{
  background:#66a6ff;
  color:white;
  border:none;
  padding:12px 20px;
  border-radius:20px;
  font-size:16px;
}
#msg{display:none;margin-top:20px;font-weight:bold;}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="card">
  <h3>😏</h3>
  <p>Энд юу байгаа бол?</p>
  <button onclick="show()">Дарж үз 😎</button>
  <div id="msg">Найз минь чи бол 🔥🔥🔥</div>
</div>

<script>
function show(){
  document.getElementById("msg").style.display="block";
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
